```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Editor
  participant Strapi
  participant ACS as Affiliate Catalog Service
  participant NextApp as Next.js App

  Editor->>Strapi: Submit offer form
  Strapi-->>ACS: Webhook payload (offer draft)
  ACS->>ACS: Validate + store + emit event
  NextApp->>ACS: Fetch offers for slug
  ACS-->>NextApp: Offer + disclosure payload
  NextApp-->>Editor: Render CTA with telemetry context
```
